1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,424
Welcome to the Reputation module!

2
00:00:02,424 --> 00:00:06,506
In this lesson, you'll connect your
Google Business Profile to Kyntlo,

3
00:00:06,506 --> 00:00:09,713
so your Google reviews flow
straight into your account,

4
00:00:09,713 --> 00:00:11,987
and your review link is ready to share.

5
00:00:12,839 --> 00:00:16,642
Reputation is where you request,
read and reply to reviews.

6
00:00:16,642 --> 00:00:18,576
It's included on the Pro plan.

7
00:00:18,576 --> 00:00:22,701
Before you connect anything, it
looks like this: no reviews yet,

8
00:00:22,701 --> 00:00:25,409
and a prompt at the top to connect Google.

9
00:00:26,258 --> 00:00:27,013
Why connect?

10
00:00:27,013 --> 00:00:30,723
Google reviews are often the
first thing new customers see.

11
00:00:30,723 --> 00:00:35,189
Once connected, you can reply from
Kyntlo, track your rating over time,

12
00:00:35,189 --> 00:00:38,019
and send people straight
to your review page.

13
00:00:38,019 --> 00:00:41,226
Plus, your average rating
shows up in your reports,

14
00:00:41,226 --> 00:00:44,497
so you can see the effect
of every request you send.

15
00:00:45,347 --> 00:00:50,476
Before you start, make sure you can sign
in to the Google account that manages your

16
00:00:50,476 --> 00:00:53,134
business profile, as
an owner or a manager.

17
00:00:53,134 --> 00:00:56,100
That's the account Kyntlo
needs permission from.

18
00:00:56,100 --> 00:00:59,684
If someone else, like a web
designer, set up your profile,

19
00:00:59,684 --> 00:01:02,033
ask them to add you as an owner first.

20
00:01:02,883 --> 00:01:04,126
Click Connect Google.

21
00:01:04,126 --> 00:01:05,903
Google's sign-in window opens.

22
00:01:05,903 --> 00:01:08,627
Choose the account that
manages your business.

23
00:01:09,520 --> 00:01:14,156
Google asks you to confirm what Kyntlo
can do: see and manage your business

24
00:01:14,156 --> 00:01:16,011
listing, and reply to reviews.

25
00:01:16,011 --> 00:01:16,753
Click Allow.

26
00:01:17,603 --> 00:01:20,449
Back in Kyntlo, choose
your business location.

27
00:01:20,449 --> 00:01:24,533
If you have more than one, pick
the one that matches this account.

28
00:01:24,533 --> 00:01:27,812
Each location should have
its own Kyntlo sub-account,

29
00:01:27,812 --> 00:01:30,348
so its reviews and reports stay separate.

30
00:01:30,348 --> 00:01:32,081
Then click Connect location.

31
00:01:32,930 --> 00:01:33,501
That's it!

32
00:01:33,501 --> 00:01:36,411
Kyntlo starts importing
your reviews straight away.

33
00:01:36,411 --> 00:01:40,407
Within a few minutes, your overview
fills up with your average rating,

34
00:01:40,407 --> 00:01:42,918
your review count and
the overall sentiment.

35
00:01:43,767 --> 00:01:48,136
You can manage this connection any
time from Settings, under Integrations.

36
00:01:48,136 --> 00:01:52,919
That's also where you'd reconnect if you
ever lose access to that Google account.

37
00:01:53,770 --> 00:01:55,629
Next, check your review link.

38
00:01:55,629 --> 00:01:59,218
Open Settings here in Reputation,
and go to Review link.

39
00:01:59,218 --> 00:02:03,449
Choose Google, and this is the
link every review request will use.

40
00:02:04,302 --> 00:02:05,839
Have a Facebook Page too?

41
00:02:05,839 --> 00:02:09,837
You can connect it as well, to
bring in Facebook recommendations.

42
00:02:09,837 --> 00:02:14,757
Then pick whichever platform matters most
to your customers as your review link.

43
00:02:15,608 --> 00:02:18,437
You'll also find a QR
code for your review link.

44
00:02:18,437 --> 00:02:23,328
Print it for your reception desk, so happy
customers can leave a review before they

45
00:02:23,328 --> 00:02:24,566
walk out of the door.

46
00:02:24,566 --> 00:02:25,509
Then click Save.

47
00:02:26,359 --> 00:02:27,419
Here's a pro tip.

48
00:02:27,419 --> 00:02:32,159
Once your reviews are in, reply to the
recent ones you haven't answered yet,

49
00:02:32,159 --> 00:02:32,970
good and bad.

50
00:02:32,970 --> 00:02:38,146
Google shows your replies publicly, and
future customers notice the businesses that

51
00:02:38,146 --> 00:02:38,645
respond.

52
00:02:39,495 --> 00:02:40,737
Google is connected!

53
00:02:40,737 --> 00:02:45,704
In the next lesson, you'll start asking
customers for reviews by text and email,

54
00:02:45,704 --> 00:02:48,870
and make it happen
automatically after every visit.

55
00:02:48,870 --> 00:02:49,740
See you there.
